# Same bytes on every PC: every text file is checked out with LF line endings,
# whatever the machine's core.autocrlf says. Git detects binary files itself.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
# Go sources are patched by scripts/mutation-check.sh with multi-line perl
# patterns that expect LF. Force LF so a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true)
# does not silently break them.
*.go text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf
# Binary assets, never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
